      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "## Skip duplicate samples with Dedupe + Gather\n\n**background (3) × lighting (3)** = 9 combinations, but the prompt template only uses `__background__`, so only **3 images are sampled**. Gather re-expands them to all 9 for the files and the 3×3 grid.\n\nAdd `__lighting__` to the template and all 9 become unique. Needs **ComfyUI-List-Utils**.\n\nSee NODE_GUIDE.md, workflow 5."
      ],
      "color": "#432",
      "bgcolor": "#653"
    },
